From 71d4cb40dc2ea0fed6503d6f249026d516f50907 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rmuxnet <116457149+rmuxnet@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Mar 2025 18:35:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] TelegramBOT: Add devices.json for comprehensive device
 metadata integration
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

This commit introduces the devices.json file into the repository. The file aggregates essential device metadata—including device names, maintainers, and support group URLs—thereby streamlining the process of dynamically fetching and displaying accurate device information via the TelegramBOT. This enhancement not only improves data accessibility for end users but also supports easier maintenance and future updates.
---
 OTA/devices.json | 152 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 152 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 OTA/devices.json

diff --git a/OTA/devices.json b/OTA/devices.json
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..5fdaf0c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/OTA/devices.json
@@ -0,0 +1,152 @@
